WEBVTT

00:00:10.404 --> 00:00:11.822
(groans)

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.877
(roars)

00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:40.184
(shrieking)

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.524
(creature shrieking)

00:00:49.401 --> 00:00:51.320
(roars)

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.033
Move!
闪开

00:00:56.116 --> 00:00:57.576
(shrieks)
闪开

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:07.044
(shrieking)

00:01:11.215 --> 00:01:12.675
We can beat this.
我们可以打败它

00:01:30.859 --> 00:01:32.319
We have to get it closer.
必须靠近它

00:01:32.403 --> 00:01:35.823
-All hands to the main deck!
-Ready the harpoons!
全体上主甲板

00:01:40.911 --> 00:01:43.455
DRINIAN: I want everybody up here!
所有人都给我上主甲板

00:01:47.793 --> 00:01:49.670
-Ready?
-Aye, sir!
好了吗？

00:01:49.753 --> 00:01:51.338
Now!
投射

00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:53.424
(all grunt)

00:01:53.507 --> 00:01:55.551
(shrieking)

00:01:57.094 --> 00:01:58.512
Pull its head down!
砍掉它的脑袋

00:02:04.727 --> 00:02:06.729
(blades ringing, clinking)

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.733
(ringing grows louder)

00:02:12.401 --> 00:02:14.486
(grunts)

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.031
(shrieking)

00:02:17.114 --> 00:02:19.617
(clattering)

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.744
-(shrieking)
-Heave!
用力

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.751
(clattering continues)

00:02:28.834 --> 00:02:30.586
(grunts)

00:02:30.669 --> 00:02:32.463
WHITE WITCH (whispering): Edmund.
埃德蒙

00:02:37.718 --> 00:02:39.803
What are you trying to prove, Edmund?
你想证明什么，埃德蒙？

00:02:41.013 --> 00:02:42.306
That you're a man?
你是男子汉？

00:02:44.016 --> 00:02:46.894
(swords clattering)

00:02:48.479 --> 00:02:52.358
(muffled shouting)
埃德蒙

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.863
I can make you that.
I can make you my king.
我能让你当国王

00:03:00.532 --> 00:03:02.451
Just take my hand.
拉住我的手

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:04.370
(snapping, cracking)
拉住我的手

00:03:04.453 --> 00:03:06.497
(yelling)

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.800
Just give in.
到此为止吧

00:03:26.976 --> 00:03:28.519
CASPIAN: Do it!
快动手

00:03:29.311 --> 00:03:31.188
Come on!
来吧

00:03:34.191 --> 00:03:36.860
No!
不

00:03:36.944 --> 00:03:39.113
-(crackling)
-(yelling)

00:03:39.196 --> 00:03:42.908
(rumbling, crackling)

00:03:53.294 --> 00:03:55.004
(deep rumbling)

00:04:00.718 --> 00:04:02.428
(thunder rumbling)

00:04:09.268 --> 00:04:12.771
The spell... it's lifting.
魔咒…

00:04:16.483 --> 00:04:17.526
Edmund!
埃德蒙

00:04:19.486 --> 00:04:21.280
LUCY: Caspian!
凯斯宾

00:04:21.363 --> 00:04:22.656
Look!
看

00:04:37.463 --> 00:04:39.006
(blades ringing)

00:04:45.721 --> 00:04:47.431
(ringing stops)

00:04:51.518 --> 00:04:55.147
-CASPIAN: Narnians! Narnians!
-(cheering and applause)
纳尼亚人

00:05:09.536 --> 00:05:12.039
-Mummy!
-Helaine!
妈妈

00:05:20.798 --> 00:05:23.467
Rhince! Gael!
莱恩斯

00:05:23.551 --> 00:05:24.969
GAEL: Mummy!
妈妈

00:05:25.761 --> 00:05:27.221
Mummy.
妈妈

00:05:29.765 --> 00:05:30.808
Mummy!
妈妈

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.066
Let's help them on board!
Clear the decks!
让大家上船，清理甲板

00:05:42.194 --> 00:05:44.113
We did it.
我们成功了

00:05:44.196 --> 00:05:46.115
I knew we would.
我知道会成功的

00:05:46.198 --> 00:05:47.533
It wasn't just us, though.
成功的不仅是我们

00:05:48.742 --> 00:05:50.536
-You mean...
-EUSTACE: Hey!
你是说…

00:05:50.619 --> 00:05:52.913
Hey! I'm down here, Lucy!
我在这儿，露西

00:05:52.997 --> 00:05:54.456
Over here!
这里

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.750
Hey, Lucy, I'm in the water! Lucy!
露西，我在水里

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:58.502
Eustace.
尤斯塔斯

00:05:58.586 --> 00:06:01.505
I'm a boy again. I'm a boy!
我又恢复了

00:06:01.589 --> 00:06:04.508
Eustace! I see your wings
have been clipped.
尤斯塔斯，你的翅膀…

00:06:04.592 --> 00:06:05.926
(laughs)
已经消失了

00:06:08.304 --> 00:06:10.639
♪ Where sky and water meet ♪
在那海天相接的地方

00:06:10.723 --> 00:06:12.558
♪ Where the waves
grow ever sweet... ♪
到处是甜蜜的海浪

00:06:13.893 --> 00:06:15.936
It is sweet. It's sweet!
水是甜的

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.730
(chuckling)
水是甜的

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.566
Look! Look!
看啊

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.199
Aslan's country.
阿斯兰的国家

00:06:30.284 --> 00:06:31.744
We must be close.
已经遥遥在望

00:06:32.661 --> 00:06:34.747
Well, we've come this far.
嗯，真没想到

00:06:47.176 --> 00:06:50.262
EDMUND: So what was it like
when Aslan changed you back?
阿斯兰帮你恢复原形时什么感觉？

00:06:51.764 --> 00:06:55.851
EUSTACE: No matter how hard I tried,
I just couldn't do it myself.
当时我拼命挣扎，可怎么也变不回来

00:06:55.935 --> 00:06:57.645
Then he came towards me.
然后他朝我走来

00:06:57.728 --> 00:07:00.856
It sort of hurt, but it was a good pain.
尽管有点疼，但我很开心

00:07:01.941 --> 00:07:04.777
You know, like when you pull
a thorn from your foot.
就好像拔出了脚上扎的刺一样

00:07:06.695 --> 00:07:08.572
Being a dragon wasn't all bad.
当龙感觉不错

00:07:08.656 --> 00:07:11.784
I mean, I think I was a better dragon
than I was a boy, really.
相比做人我更适合当龙

00:07:13.118 --> 00:07:14.912
I'm so sorry for being such a sop.
很遗憾我的意志不太坚定

00:07:15.579 --> 00:07:16.997
It's okay, Eustace.
没关系，尤斯塔斯

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.458
You are a pretty good dragon.
你是一条非常出色的龙

00:07:23.671 --> 00:07:26.799
My friends, we have arrived.
朋友们，我们到了

